{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52528","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羲和停火轮，霡霂深民福。\n年康收篚文，庭寔陈秋获。\n土产若未腴，勤绥功则博。\n九五垂衣裳，千万监忠朴。\n铜虎谨深悬，木铎今始作。\n诰勅常佩吟，酒色难湎惑。\n愿皇钦福多，锡民无灾瘼。\n载答圣皇恩，转轮赴河洛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}